==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Zapdos|145}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Zapdos}}.
*'''Raging Thunder''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Zapdos|S2}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 2}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

